 ## Subtopics
 
 ### Manifold Exploration
-A mutation strategy for Metropolis light transport that improves sampling for paths involving specular and highly glossy surfaces, and is usable for participating media surrounded by refractive boundaries. The manifold exploration idea further benefits next event estimation (NEE) by enabling connections through multiple refracting surfaces [S1].
